 "section_summary": "This section contains English summaries of Station JLU4 broadcasts from early July 1941, including a program already in progress on page 304. The programs report Japan’s policy after Germany’s invasion of the Soviet Union, the recognition of the Nanking government, fighting in China, and developments in Europe and the United States. They also include domestic news, music, talks promoting Japan’s war effort, and a partly recorded broadcast marking the fourth anniversary of the China Incident.",
